"color":"color","runtime":"14:48","contact":"<a href='http://blender.org/>Blender Institute</a>","language":"English","backup_location":"ia903606_21","ia_orig__runtime":"14 minutes 48 seconds"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"I hope that such a great work does not vanish from the internet, for me, it is better than any famous film, but do not take this so seriously because I hate all mainstream media anyways.\n\n\tI just wish I could have a job and a bank account so I could donate some money to the foundation.","reviewtitle":"Beautiful","reviewer":"ADFENO","reviewdate":"2012-06-10 13:51:52","createdate":"2012-06-10 13:51:52","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"This was really sad but at the same time really good.","reviewtitle":"Great show","reviewer":"jen-singhlovespuppies","reviewdate":"2015-09-07 14:35:49","createdate":"2015-09-07 14:35:49","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"This is stunning--the voices, the facial expressions, the spot-on scenics, perfect lighting.  My only (and admittedly minor) comment is the eyes of the girl.  They seem too small and puffy, and for me, at least, detract a bit from the movie itself.  \nBeyond that, I have only  praise for this.","reviewtitle":"It Doesnt Get Any  Better Than This","reviewer":"judyt54","reviewdate":"2016-04-21 13:19:19","createdate":"2016-04-21 13:19:07","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Amazing piece of work","reviewtitle":"Superb","reviewer":"wvrly","reviewer_itemname":"@wvrly","reviewdate":"2018-11-16 07:24:43","createdate":"2018-11-16 07:24:43","stars":"5"},{"reviewtitle":"sad face","reviewbody":"we watched this thinking it was a cutesy little feel good but we do not feel good and its made both of us feel bad at bed time :(","stars":"1","reviewer":"twilightpoo67","reviewdate":"2026-01-24 23:22:23","createdate":"2026-01-24 23:22:23","reviewer_itemname":"@twilightpoo67"}],"server":"dn601208.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn601208":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5451113690"},"sys_last_change